WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.090 --> 00:00:04.880
Down for the Count, a climbing-shedding game where you don't wanna shed.

2
00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:08.330
Every card you play brings you closer to being out.

3
00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:13.270
So each turn: play strong to knock out your opponents, or hold back to outlast them.

4
00:00:14.210 --> 00:00:16.950
Each turn, beat the move on the table with a better one.

5
00:00:17.450 --> 00:00:19.420
Can't beat it? Spend stamina:

6
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:22.720
you could reverse to take a card off the move into your hand,

7
00:00:22.750 --> 00:00:26.070
or kick out to take a stamina card into your hand.

8
00:00:26.600 --> 00:00:29.450
Out of stamina and you need some? You're pinned.

9
00:00:29.990 --> 00:00:32.330
Play your last card, and you tap out.

10
00:00:32.640 --> 00:00:37.000
Last wrestler standing wins the round, and everyone scores by how long they lasted.

11
00:00:38.180 --> 00:00:41.900
The game is made up of sixty cards: ten moves, six of each.

12
00:00:42.000 --> 00:00:46.340
Plays two to five players, with five-minute rounds, about fifteen minutes total.

13
00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:52.580
Down for the Count. Play it in your browser at darrendon.com, or email me for a prototype.

